<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NeuroNauts Reading Room</title>
<meta name="description" content="Reading room for the NeuroNauts Scholars Program: curated papers and a field glossary.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Unbounded:wght@400;600;700&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============================================================================
   NeuroNauts Mission Console  ::  STYLES
============================================================================ */
:root{
  --ink:#0a0e23;
  --ink-2:#0d1330;
  --panel:rgba(20,28,64,.55);
  --panel-solid:#121a3a;
  --line:rgba(120,150,230,.18);
  --line-bright:rgba(120,170,255,.4);
  --text:#e8edff;
  --text-dim:#9aa7d4;
  --text-faint:#6b78a8;
  --cyan:#5eead4;
  --cyan-2:#22d3ee;
  --amber:#fbbf24;
  --amber-soft:rgba(251,191,36,.14);
  --violet:#a78bfa;
  --pink:#f472b6;
  --shadow:0 18px 50px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.7);
  --r:18px;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:"Hanken Grotesk",system-ui,sans-serif;
  color:var(--text);
  background:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.55;
  min-height:100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}

/* starfield + nebula */
.cosmos{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-2;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 78% -10%, rgba(124,99,255,.20), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(900px 600px at 8% 12%, rgba(34,211,238,.13), transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(800px 800px at 50% 120%, rgba(244,114,182,.10), transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#080b1c 0%, #0a0e23 40%, #0a0d20 100%);
}
.stars{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.7;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(1.4px 1.4px at 20% 30%, #fff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1.2px 1.2px at 70% 60%, #cfe0ff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 40% 80%, #fff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1.6px 1.6px at 85% 22%, #fff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 55% 12%, #bcd, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1.2px 1.2px at 12% 70%, #fff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 78%, #cfe0ff, transparent);
  background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;
  animation:drift 120s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes drift{to{background-position:600px 800px}}

a{color:var(--cyan-2);text-decoration:none}
a:hover{color:var(--cyan)}

.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
.mono{font-family:"Space Mono",ui-monospace,monospace}

/* ---------- LOGIN ---------- */
#login{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:40px 22px}
.login-card{
  width:min(440px,100%);background:var(--panel);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:38px 34px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);text-align:center;
  animation:rise .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both;
}
.badge{
  width:74px;height:74px;margin:0 auto 18px;border-radius:50%;
  display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:34px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #20306e, #0c1233 80%);
  border:1px solid var(--line-bright);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(94,234,212,.06), 0 0 40px -6px rgba(94,234,212,.4);
}
.brand{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.55rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1}
.brand .neuro{color:var(--text)}
.brand .nauts{color:var(--cyan)}
.tagline{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:8px}
.kicker{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.28em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-faint);margin-bottom:14px}
.field{text-align:left;margin-top:20px}
.field label{display:block;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--text-faint);margin-bottom:8px;font-family:"Space Mono",monospace}
.who{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.who button{flex:1;min-width:96px;padding:12px 6px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);
  font-family:inherit;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;transition:.18s}
.who button:hover{border-color:var(--line-bright);background:rgba(94,234,212,.08)}
.who button.sel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(94,234,212,.22),rgba(34,211,238,.12));
  border-color:var(--cyan);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 24px -8px var(--cyan)}
input[type=password],input[type=text].search{
  width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);font-family:inherit;font-size:1rem;outline:none;transition:.18s}
input[type=password]:focus{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(94,234,212,.15)}
.launch{margin-top:22px;width:100%;padding:14px;border:none;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#06241f;
  background:linear-gradient(95deg,var(--cyan),var(--cyan-2));transition:.18s;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px -10px rgba(34,211,238,.6)}
.launch:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:brightness(1.06)}
.err{color:var(--pink);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:12px;min-height:1em}
.hint{color:var(--text-faint);font-size:.76rem;margin-top:16px}

/* ---------- APP SHELL ---------- */
#app{display:none}
header.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(8,11,28,.9),rgba(8,11,28,.55));
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.top-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
  max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 22px}
.top .brand{font-size:1.05rem}
.greet{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-dim);letter-spacing:.05em}
.greet b{color:var(--cyan)}
.logout{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text-dim);
  padding:7px 13px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em}
.logout:hover{border-color:var(--pink);color:var(--pink)}

nav.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 18px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav.tabs button{background:none;border:none;color:var(--text-faint);cursor:pointer;
  padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;font-family:inherit;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;transition:.16s}
nav.tabs button:hover{color:var(--text)}
nav.tabs button.active{color:var(--cyan);background:var(--panel);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--cyan)}

main{padding:26px 0 80px}
.view{display:none;animation:fade .4s ease both}
.view.show{display:block}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

h2.section{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.35rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:4px}
.sub{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:20px}

/* ---------- TODAY CARD ---------- */
.today-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line-bright);border-radius:var(--r);
  padding:26px 26px 22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.today-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-2px;z-index:0;
  background:radial-gradient(400px 200px at 90% -20%, rgba(94,234,212,.16), transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
.today-tag{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--cyan);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;position:relative}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--cyan);
  animation:pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.4;transform:scale(.7)}}
.today-date{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-size:1.5rem;margin:8px 0 2px;position:relative}
.today-theme{color:var(--amber);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;position:relative}
.blocks{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;position:relative}
.block{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.block .lbl{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px}
.block.lab .lbl{color:var(--cyan)}
.block.prog .lbl{color:var(--violet)}
.block p{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--text)}
.no-session{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:.95rem;margin-top:6px;position:relative}

/* log controls */
.log-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative}
.check{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem}
.check input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:0;height:0}
.box{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;border:1.5px solid var(--line-bright);
  display:grid;place-items:center;transition:.16s;color:transparent;font-size:.85rem}
.check input:checked + .box{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cyan),var(--cyan-2));border-color:var(--cyan);color:#06241f}
.note{flex:1;min-width:220px}
.note textarea{width:100%;min-height:46px;resize:vertical;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);font-family:inherit;font-size:.9rem;outline:none}
.note textarea:focus{border-color:var(--cyan)}
.saved{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--cyan);opacity:0;transition:.3s}
.saved.on{opacity:1}

/* progress bar */
.progress-wrap{margin-top:22px}
.bar{height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.bar > i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;width:0;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet));transition:width .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.progress-wrap .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;
  font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:8px}

/* ---------- SCHEDULE ---------- */
.week{margin-bottom:26px}
.week-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0 2px 12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.week-num{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--text)}
.week-theme{color:var(--amber);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600}
.day{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--panel);transition:.18s}
.day:hover{border-color:var(--line-bright)}
.day.is-today{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 28px -10px var(--cyan)}
.day .when{padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--line);
  background:rgba(0,0,0,.18);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.day .when .dow{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-faint);letter-spacing:.1em}
.day .when .dnum{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-size:1.2rem}
.day .when .mon{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-dim)}
.day .body{padding:13px 16px;font-size:.9rem}
.day .body .prog{color:var(--text-dim)}
.day .body .lab{color:var(--text);margin-top:6px}
.day .body .lab b{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600}
.pill{display:inline-block;font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.14em;
  text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;margin-bottom:8px}
.pill.lab{color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(94,234,212,.12);border:1px solid rgba(94,234,212,.3)}
.pill.program{color:var(--violet);background:rgba(167,139,250,.12);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.3)}
.pill.mixed{color:#9be7ff;background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.3)}
.pill.milestone{color:var(--amber);background:var(--amber-soft);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.35)}
.pill.holiday{color:var(--text-faint);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.day.holiday{opacity:.65}
.todaymark{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:.12em}

/* ---------- LIBRARY ---------- */
.lib-controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px;align-items:center}
.search{flex:1;min-width:200px}
.filters{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.filters button{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text-dim);
  padding:8px 13px;border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;transition:.16s}
.filters button:hover{border-color:var(--line-bright);color:var(--text)}
.filters button.on{background:rgba(94,234,212,.14);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan)}
.cat-group{margin-bottom:26px}
.cat-title{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-size:1rem;margin:0 2px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.cat-title span.n{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;color:var(--text-faint)}
.paper{display:flex;gap:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;
  margin-bottom:10px;background:var(--panel);transition:.18s}
.paper:hover{border-color:var(--line-bright);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.paper.read{opacity:.62}
.paper .read-toggle{flex:none}
.paper .read-toggle .box{width:26px;height:26px}
.paper .info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.paper .ptitle{font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.35}
.paper .ptitle a{color:var(--text)}
.paper .ptitle a:hover{color:var(--cyan)}
.paper .psrc{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-faint);margin:5px 0 8px}
.paper .pwhy{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--text-dim)}
.paper .ptags{margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.lvl{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px}
.lvl.start{color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(94,234,212,.12);border:1px solid rgba(94,234,212,.3)}
.lvl.core{color:var(--violet);background:rgba(167,139,250,.12);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.3)}
.lvl.deep{color:var(--amber);background:var(--amber-soft);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.3)}
.open-link{font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;color:var(--cyan-2);letter-spacing:.06em}

/* ---------- GLOSSARY ---------- */
.glossary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px}
.gloss{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;background:var(--panel);transition:.18s}
.gloss:hover{border-color:var(--line-bright)}
.gloss dt{font-family:"Unbounded",sans-serif;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:6px}
.gloss dd{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--text-dim)}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px;text-align:center;
  color:var(--text-faint);font-family:"Space Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.06em}

@media (max-width:560px){
  .today-date{font-size:1.25rem}
  nav.tabs button{padding:9px 12px;font-size:.85rem}
}

/* ---------- library header (added) ---------- */
.lib-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.read-count{flex:none;color:var(--cyan);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.06em;
  border:1px solid rgba(94,234,212,.3);background:rgba(94,234,212,.1);
  padding:7px 13px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:4px}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cosmos"></div>
<div class="stars"></div>

<!-- ===================== LOGIN ===================== -->
<section id="login">
  <div class="login-card">
    <div class="badge">&#129528;</div>
    <div class="kicker">Reading Room</div>
    <div class="brand"><span class="neuro">Neuro</span><span class="nauts">Nauts</span></div>
    <div class="tagline">Scholars Program &middot; <span id="brand-cohort"></span></div>

    <div class="field">
      <label>Who is logging in?</label>
      <div class="who" id="who"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label>Program passcode</label>
      <input type="password" id="pass" placeholder="Enter passcode" autocomplete="off">
    </div>
    <button class="launch" id="launch">Enter the reading room &#128214;</button>
    <div class="err" id="err"></div>
    <div class="hint">Your "read" checkmarks are saved on this device only.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== APP ===================== -->
<div id="app">
  <header class="top">
    <div class="top-inner">
      <div class="brand"><span class="neuro">Neuro</span><span class="nauts">Nauts</span></div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px">
        <span class="greet">scholar :: <b id="greet-name"></b> &middot; <span id="brand-mentor"></span></span>
        <button class="logout" id="logout">log out</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="tabs">
      <button data-view="library" class="active">Paper Library</button>
      <button data-view="glossary">Glossary</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <!-- LIBRARY -->
    <section id="view-library" class="view show">
      <div class="lib-head">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section">Paper library</h2>
          <p class="sub">Start with the green "start here" papers, then work toward the deep dives. Check a paper off once you have read it.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="read-count mono" id="read-count">0 read</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lib-controls">
        <input type="text" id="lib-search" class="search" placeholder="Search titles and topics...">
      </div>
      <div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
      <div id="library"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- GLOSSARY -->
    <section id="view-glossary" class="view">
      <h2 class="section">Field glossary</h2>
      <p class="sub">Quick definitions for the words you will hear most this summer.</p>
      <dl class="glossary" id="glossary"></dl>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>NeuroNauts Scholars Program &middot; supported by NIH NINDS R25 &middot; University of West Florida</footer>
</div>

<script>
/* ---- data ---- */
/* ============================================================================
   NeuroNauts Reading Room  ::  DATA + CONFIG
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   EDIT THIS FILE to change scholars, the passcode, the reading list, or the
   glossary. No build step. Save, commit, push.

   PRIVACY: GitHub Pages is public and everything here is visible in the page
   source. These scholars are minors. Use first names or callsigns only. No
   last names, schools, photos, or emails. The passcode is a soft gate, not
   real security.
============================================================================ */

const CONFIG = {
  cohort: "Cohort 1  ::  Summer 2026",
  mentor: "Dr. Guttmann",
  passcode: "synapse2026",            // change this and share with your scholars
  scholars: ["Lukas", "Victoria", "Francesca"]
};

/* ---- Reading library --------------------------------------------------------
   cat:   the category heading a paper sits under (see ORDER in app.js)
   level: "start" (start here) | "core" | "deep" (deep dive)
   Add or remove entries freely.                                                */
const PAPERS = [

  // ===== OUR PROJECT: phage display meets Alzheimer's =====
  { id:"op-thno22", cat:"Our Project", level:"start",
    title:"Phage display derived peptides for Alzheimer's disease therapy and diagnosis",
    source:"Theranostics, 2022",
    why:"The best single map of what our lab does. Read this first to see how phage display turns into an Alzheimer's biomarker tool.",
    url:"https://www.thno.org/v12p2041.htm" },
  { id:"op-art24", cat:"Our Project", level:"core",
    title:"High-affinity antibodies to the core region of tau with diagnostic and therapeutic potential for AD",
    source:"Alzheimer's Research and Therapy, 2024",
    why:"A real biopanning campaign that selects antibodies against disease relevant tau. A close cousin of your summer project.",
    url:"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13195-024-01561-1" },

  // ===== PHAGE DISPLAY =====
  { id:"pd-nobel", cat:"Phage Display", level:"start",
    title:"Phage Display: Simple Evolution in a Petri Dish (Nobel Lecture)",
    source:"George P. Smith, 2018 Nobel Prize in Chemistry",
    why:"The origin story, told by the man who won the Nobel for it. Short and genuinely fun.",
    url:"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/chemistry/2018/smith/lecture/" },
  { id:"pd-basics", cat:"Phage Display", level:"core",
    title:"Basics of Antibody Phage Display Technology",
    source:"Toxins (review), 2018",
    why:"The clearest walk through the M13 phage, library types, and the rounds of panning you will run at the bench.",
    url:"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6024766/" },
  { id:"pd-evo", cat:"Phage Display", level:"deep",
    title:"Evolution of phage display libraries for therapeutic antibody discovery",
    source:"mAbs (review), 2023",
    why:"How three generations of libraries were designed. Read once the basics feel comfortable.",
    url:"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10210849/" },
  { id:"pd-phipseq", cat:"Phage Display", level:"deep",
    title:"Phage Immunoprecipitation and Sequencing (PhIP-seq) for mapping the antibody reactome",
    source:"Review, 2024",
    why:"A modern, high throughput spin on phage display used to fish out disease antibodies. A glimpse of where the field is heading.",
    url:"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39168282/" },

  // ===== TAU BIOLOGY AND PATHOLOGY =====
  { id:"tau-adv", cat:"Tau Biology", level:"start",
    title:"Advances in the Pathogenesis of AD: Focusing on Tau-Mediated Neurodegeneration",
